; Axis D (variant discriminant) — positive direction.
;
; The `track` form is discriminated on `:kind` (typed as
; `kind-tag`, a closed-enum value-kind), which defaults to the
; symbol `kick`. The author writes `(track)` — no `:kind`, no
; other keys. With axis D off the discriminant lookup sees no
; author kvpair -> `missing_discriminant_key` at `[track]`. With
; axis D on the overlay yields `kind = kick` -> variant `kick`
; selected and silent.
;
; `expected.sjon` matches the axis-off baseline.
(plugin :name probe :version "1.0.0"
  (value-kind :name kind-tag
    :underlying symbol
    :members (member-set :values [kick bass]))
  (form :name track
    :discriminant kind
    (key :name kind :type kind-tag :default kick :optional true)
    (variant :when kick
      (key :name step :type number :optional true))
    (variant :when bass
      (key :name sequence :type any :optional true))))

(track)
